    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional site with full planning permission, superbly positioned in the prestigious Site 2:  Greengates area of Blackrock, Co. Louth. This is a rare opportunity to secure a prime residential site in one of the North East’s most sought-after coastal locations, just moments from Blackrock promenade and the stunning shoreline of Dundalk Bay. \r\n\r\n\r\nDetails : The site benefits from full planning permission for a beautifully designed 4 bedroom detached home extending to over 2,000 sq. ft., offering the perfect setting to create a truly bespoke family residence. With water and mains sewer connections available at the site boundary, levies already paid, and full planning permission valid until December 2028, this site offers outstanding potential while providing significant cost-saving benefits for the purchaser.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation : Blackrock is one of County Louth’s most desirable seaside villages, renowned for its relaxed coastal atmosphere, strong sense of community and superb quality of life. The village offers daily walks along the promenade and beach, easy access to cafés, shops and restaurants, and a lifestyle that perfectly balances seaside living with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location is especially convenient, with Dundalk Town just 5km away and direct access to the M1 Dublin-Belfast corridor only a short drive from the village. For families,  and commuters alike, this is a location that offers the rare combination of coastal charm, accessibility and long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a site in a location where supply is extremely limited and demand remains consistently strong. Sites of this calibre in Blackrock rarely come to the market.\r\n\r\n\r\nFor all further inquiries, contact Blue Sky Property : 042 932 9333. Guide Price €200,000.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Full planning permission for a stunning 2,000+ sq. ft. detached residence.\r\nAccommodation designed for 4 spacious bedrooms.\r\nLevies paid, including sewer and water charges.\r\nMains sewer available on the site boundary.\r\nPlanning permission valid until December 2028.\r\nHighly regarded Greengates location within Blackrock Village\r\nArchitectural plans available upon request."
      }
